// Contact Name : Seer Marino 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1040075632" "Seer Marino"
// ProfessionString :
"P1333957046" "Fortunata Seer"
// DescriptionString :
"P3414721608" "An Arachnos veteran of nearly 15 years service, Fortunata Seer Pia Marino joined in her youth along with her older brother, Paolo. The two had grown up in the Rogue Isles under Lord Recluse's rule, and joined Arachnos together to improve their lot in life. Pia was soon singled out as one of the few with a precognitive gift, and was brought into the ranks of the Fortunata Seers. Her brother Paolo suffered an unfortunate fate, and is listed as missing, presumed dead. While Seer Marino has served Arachnos with distinction, during her career, she has not sought to advance her powers or position since Paolo's presumed death."
// HelloString :
"P785266427" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I've been expecting you.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P3408943760" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>You are here earlier than I anticipated.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P3425621857" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>You have arrived at just the right moment.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1411550168" "I'm sorry, but please, could you leave me be with my memories?"
// FirstVisitString :
"P204216640" "I had a feeling that perhaps we had met before? I could be wrong, of course. That is a problem for we Seers of the Fortunata. As the years roll on, the here-and-now begins to blend with the soon-to-be, and we loose track if we let our minds wander. And all it seems my mind can do is wander these days. To thoughts of my youth, of the friends I've lost, and to my brother Paolo, dead all these years. But that is why I wished to speak with you. There are things I must know about what happened to my brother, and you have a growing reputation as someone who can get things done."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P194761645" "The Arbiters have judged, and applauded my loyalty and your ability. We are not suspects, and we are not conspirators. Ghost Widow has told me as much. She has also told me why my brother will never return to me, even if some part of him is still alive within poor Wretch. I think it is time that both of us tried to move on."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1916059069" "Pay due attention to the tasks before you, {VillainName}. Concentrate on a few specific tasks and accomplish them. When you have less to do before you, speak with me."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3465646664" "I have learned the value of patience in my years of service to Arachnos. Return to me when you are threat level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3670697436" "I fear we are falling deeper into a shadow. I only hope that when all is done, the Arbiters are merciful. You must <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>strengthen yourself</a> for the trials ahead. And please, keep in touch."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3532512247" "We are now enmeshed together in this conspiracy. We must rely on each other to escape alive. If you hope to live through this, you will need the best <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Enhancements.</a>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P737362759" "We must not speak. Your power would draw too much attention to me."
// LocationString :
"P2613846116" "Mercy Island"
// IntroString :
"P3073025296" "There's a Fortunata Seer named Pia Marino who's been putting out subtle hints that she's looking for someone who can get things done outside Arachnos. The rumor is that she's shown an unusual interest in the origins of Ghost Widow and the Wretch. She can get her hands on Mutant and Magic Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P156673675" "Choose Fortunata Seer Marino"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3595595337" "No one really knows what Seer Marino is after. Rumor is that her interest in Ghost Widow and Wretch may be based around revenge."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P76270029" "I know of someone who might want to speak to you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2608508036" "There are some people I know who might want to speak with you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

